  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan. Supporting Peaceful and Inclusive Transition in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overarching aim: Support the Transitional Government of Sudan (TGOS), other political actors, civil society constituencies, women, and youth for a peaceful and inclusive transition in the Sudan.
To achieve this objective, the program of work will deliver support activities in three primary need- and demand-driven areas: 
1.	support to the Conference of the People of Eastern Sudan (&#x201c;Eastern Sudan Conference&#x201d;); 
2.	support to System of Governance Conference;
3.	capacity building and other support to Sudan Revolutionary Front (SRF) and other constituencies to effectively engage in transition processes.</narrative>
  </description>
